usage: module-nav [-h] [--base-dir DIR] <command> [<args>]

Module Navigator - CLI for Niagara N4 decompiled modules

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --base-dir, -d BASE_DIR
                        Base directory (auto-detected if omitted)

commands (module-nav <command> --help for its options):

  Inventory and self-checks:
    selftest                Self-checks; --recall verifies `class` finds every declaration in organized/
    inventory               Summary of all indexed modules
    module                  Detailed info for a specific submodule
    modules                 List modules with filters
    stats                   Corpus summary (modules, classes, indexes)

  Find classes and concepts:
    class                   Look up a class by exact name
    search                  Search classes by glob pattern
    package                 List classes in a package
    profile                 Combined class + source + UI view
    full-profile            Combined view from BOTH navigators
    cross-ref               Docs + implementation + who uses it
    find                    Fuzzy search in class names (camelCase-aware); see also: rank
    ask                     Same as `rank` (ranked classes for a question); see also: grep
    explain                 Cross-reference a concept across devguide/guides/bajadoc + code; see also: rank, grep
    unified                 Search Help + Module + BOG simultaneously; see also: rank, grep
    compare                 Docs vs implementation vs station usage

  Source text, strings and resources:
    grep                    Regex search across all decompiled sources
    rank                    Classes most relevant to a free-text question (EN/ES), best first
    source                  Show info or source code for a class
    snippet                 Extract a specific method's source code
    imports                 Raw import statements from the .java header (includes externals)
    strings                 Search string literals across source; see also: grep
    resources               List non-Java resources in module JAR
    token                   Exact token search (instant via SQLite index)
    resources-usage         How resources of a module are used
    string-search           Regex search in indexed string literals (instant via SQLite); see also: grep
    string-constants        All string literals in a class (categorized)

  Types: hierarchy, members, imports:
    hierarchy               Show subclass tree or inheritance chain
    implementors            Show classes implementing an interface
    xref                    Show cross-references (imports/importers) for a class
    deps                    Show module-level dependencies
    method                  Show classes that define a given method
    methods                 List all methods of a class
    slots                   Show Niagara slots (properties, actions, topics)
    annotations             List classes with a specific Niagara annotation
    deps-graph              Module dependency graph
    trace-type              Map Niagara type to Java class
    version-diff            Compare with another class-index.json
    fields                  List all fields of a class
    field                   Show classes that define a given field

  Call and data flow:
    callers                 Who calls this method (or, without one, every method of the class)
    callees                 What methods this class/method calls
    call-chain              Transitive call chain (tree)
    hotspots                Most-called methods (hub analysis)
    type-consumers          Methods that receive this type as parameter
    type-producers          Methods that return this type
    type-flow               Producer -> consumer chain for a type
    module-calls            Methods of target module called from source module
    module-api-usage        Top external methods used by a module
    coupling                Coupling metrics between two modules
    impact                  Transitive impact analysis for a class or method
    virtual-callers         Aggregate callers via virtual dispatch (inheritance chain)
    full-stack-trace        Call chain with semantic annotations (input, BQL, data-source, serialize, output)

  UI and Swing:
    ui                      UI/Swing pattern search (dialogs, sizes, colors, fonts)

  Patching:
    patch-target            Find patchable classes by natural language query
    patch-plan              Generate a complete patch plan for a class
    extract                 Extract class to working directory for editing
    export                  Export class report or module diagram

  Code quality:
    orphans                 Find classes never imported (dead code)
    api-surface             Public API surface of a module
    security-audit          Scan for insecure patterns
    deprecated              List @Deprecated classes and methods
    deprecated-users        Who uses a deprecated class or method
    deprecated-risk         Deprecated usage risk summary
    similar                 Find classes with similar structure
    clones                  Top duplicate class pairs
    config-usage            Classes that read configuration
    config-keys             Top config keys referenced in code
    serial                  Serialization info for a class
    serial-audit            Audit Serializable classes: missing UIDs, risks
    serial-conflicts        Classes with same serialVersionUID (collision)
    thread-safety           Thread safety analysis for a class
    thread-scan             Module-wide thread safety summary
    lifecycle               Lifecycle methods implemented by a class
    lifecycle-scan          Classes with lifecycle overrides

  Architecture and dependencies:
    patterns                Detect architectural patterns in a module
    pattern                 List all classes matching a pattern category
    throws                  Methods with throws declarations in a class
    catches                 Classes that catch this exception type
    cycles                  Cyclic module dependencies (DFS/Tarjan)
    god-classes             Classes with excessive methods/fields/deps
    layer-check             Layer violations: RT must not import WB/UX
    complexity              Complexity metrics for a class
    complexity-scan         Ranking of most complex classes
    metrics                 Module-level complexity summary

  Niagara domain: drivers, servlets, ORDs, topics, BQL, alarms, BOG:
    drivers                 Driver networks and their anatomy (device, extensions, managers, license)
    bog-trace               Trace BOG component to Java class with profile
    bog-classes             List unique Niagara types in BOG + Java resolution
    bog-coverage            Code-base vs BOG coverage analysis
    servlets                List all web servlets with their routes and HTTP handlers
    routes                  Map HTTP verbs to servlet classes and handler methods
    servlet                 Detailed info for a specific servlet class
    ords                    List all ORDs (Object Resolution Descriptors) grouped by scheme
    ord-usage               Classes that use a specific ORD scheme
    ord-flow                ORDs created/resolved by a specific class
    topics                  List all @NiagaraTopic declarations with publishers/subscribers
    subscribers             Who subscribes to or fires a specific topic or class
    pub-sub                 Publish->subscribe graph for a module
    bql                     List BQL/SQL queries found in the corpus
    bql-tables              Tables/sources most queried by BQL and SQL
    bql-class               BQL/SQL queries used by a specific class
    alarm-flow              Classes in the alarm chain by role
    alarm-types             Alarm types defined in the corpus
    alarm-trace             Role of a class in the alarm flow

  Security, licensing and permissions:
    license-feature         Call sites that check or read a licensed feature (checkFeature/getFeature)
    license-features        Licensed feature names with counts; --module: features a module requires
    permissions             List classes with permission checks and auth methods
    license-inspect         Parse installed .license files and aggregate features
    policy-inspect          Parse bin/policy/{signing.properties,java.policy,java.security}
    trust-anchor-check      Verify a JAR's signer cert against the trust anchor
    bypass-status           Report skipModuleValidation & security-manager-disable bypass state
    permission-report       Aggregate declared java-permissions into the 19 devguide groups
    feasibility-check       Simulate whether a module+cert would deploy against the trust anchor
    permission-flow         Permission verification chain for a class
    credentials             Detect credential handling (password, token, secret)

  Module audits:
    integration-contract    Extract integration contract from real corpus usages
    example-mine            Mine real usage examples (full method bodies) of a class
    feature-brief           One-command research brief for a Niagara feature domain
    slot-validate           Pre-flight validation for @NiagaraProperty slots
    slot-collision          Detect slot name collisions across modules
    ord-validate            Validate ORDs referencing non-existent station tree paths
    resolve-audit           Audit .resolve() calls for null-safety
    driver-cleanup-audit    Audit driver doStop() cleanup
    resource-leak           Audit resource acquisitions for missing close()
    service-order           Analyze service startup order issues
    dependency-audit        Audit third-party and external dependencies
    module-health           Overall module health scorecard (A/B/C/D/F)
    palette-lexicon-agents  Palette entries, lexicon keys (+ dup-key report), and agent registrations for a module

  Session: bookmarks, history, REPL:
    repl                    Interactive REPL with all commands
    bookmark                Save a class bookmark with optional note
    bookmarks               List all bookmarks
    unbookmark              Remove a bookmark
    history                 Show command history
    session                 Session save/load/export management
